30.9 An amount paid to indemnify the trustee in accordance with this deed;
30.10 An amount credited to the pension account of a beneficiary;
30.11 A levy;
30.12 Any other amount the trustee thinks it appropriate to debit or is required to debit
in accordance with superannuation law.
Contributions-split requests
31 A member may ask the trustee (in a way that satisfies the requirements of superannuation
law) that contributions made to the fund in respect of that member in the previous financial
year be:
31.1 allotted to the accumulation account of that member's spouse; or
31.2 rolled-over or transferred to the trustee of an approved benefit arrangement of
which that member's spouse has joined or is eligible to join.

