 this or any other document includes the document as varied or replaced
regardless of any change in the identity of the parties;
 writing includes all modes of representing or reproducing words in a legible,
permanent and visible form;
 ‘$’ or ‘dollars’ is a reference to Australian dollars;
 the word 'includes' in any form is not a word of limitation;
 the singular includes the plural and vice versa; and
 a gender includes the other gender.
